# What is JayJay?
what-is-jayjay = JayJay 是什麼？

# A native GUI for <a href="https://github.com/jj-vcs/jj">Jujutsu (jj)</a> on macOS and Linux — the version control system that reimagines the git model with mutable history, changes instead of commits, and bookmarks instead of branches. Built with Rust (wrapping <code>jj-lib</code> directly, no CLI scraping) and SwiftUI.
a-native-gui-for-jujutsu-jj = <a href="https://github.com/jj-vcs/jj">Jujutsu (jj)</a> 的原生圖形用戶端，支援 macOS 與 Linux。Jujutsu 是重新構想 git 模型的版本控制系統，使用可變歷史，以變更取代提交，以書籤取代分支。JayJay 以 Rust（直接封裝 <code>jj-lib</code>，不解析 CLI 輸出）和 SwiftUI 打造。

# Is there a GUI for Jujutsu?
is-there-a-gui-for-jujutsu = Jujutsu 有圖形介面嗎？

# Yes — JayJay is a full-featured native jj GUI for macOS and Linux: DAG visualization, unified + side-by-side diffs with tree-sitter highlighting, interdiff, diff edit mode, file annotate, one-click conflict resolution, and every common jj operation (squash, split, absorb, revert, merge, duplicate, describe, abandon) without memorizing flags.
yes-jayjay-is-a-full-featured = 有。JayJay 是適用於 macOS 與 Linux 的全功能原生 jj 圖形用戶端：DAG 視覺化、具 tree-sitter 高亮的統一與並排差異、interdiff、差異編輯模式、檔案逐行追溯、一鍵解決衝突，以及所有常用 jj 操作（squash、split、absorb、revert、merge、duplicate、describe、abandon），無需記憶指令參數。

