# How do I install JayJay on Linux?
how-do-i-install-jayjay-on-2 = 如何在 Linux 上安裝 JayJay？

# Run <code>curl -fsSL https://jayjay.hewig.dev/install.sh | bash</code>. The <a href="install.sh">script</a> installs the latest Debian package on apt-based systems and the AppImage elsewhere for x86_64 or aarch64, after verifying its checksum; run it again to upgrade. On Arch Linux, install <a href="https://aur.archlinux.org/packages/jayjay-appimage"><code>jayjay-appimage</code> from AUR</a>, for example with <code>yay -S jayjay-appimage</code>. Add <code>--beta</code> to install the newest beta when it is ahead of stable. Then run <code>jayjay /path/to/repo</code> or open a repository from the window. The <a href="guide.html#gpui">guide</a> lists what it covers.
run-curl-fssl-https-jayjay-hewig = 執行 <code>curl -fsSL https://jayjay.hewig.dev/install.sh | bash</code>。該<a href="install.sh">指令碼</a>會先驗證校驗和，再於以 apt 為基礎的系統上安裝最新的 Debian 套件，於其他 x86_64 或 aarch64 系統上安裝 AppImage；再次執行即可升級。在 Arch Linux 上，請安裝 <a href="https://aur.archlinux.org/packages/jayjay-appimage">AUR 中的 <code>jayjay-appimage</code></a>，例如 <code>yay -S jayjay-appimage</code>。加上 <code>--beta</code> 可在有比穩定版更新的測試版時安裝它。之後執行 <code>jayjay /path/to/repo</code>，或在視窗中開啟儲存庫。<a href="guide.html#gpui">指南</a>（英文）列出了支援的內容。

# How do I install JayJay on Arch Linux?
how-do-i-install-jayjay-on-3 = 如何在 Arch Linux 上安裝 JayJay？

# Install <a href="https://aur.archlinux.org/packages/jayjay-appimage"><code>jayjay-appimage</code> from AUR</a> for x86_64 or aarch64, for example with <code>yay -S jayjay-appimage</code>. The custom pacman repo has been retired; remove the entire <code>[jayjay]</code> section from <code>/etc/pacman.conf</code> before upgrading through AUR. To try an AppImage beta, remove the installed package first, then run the Linux installer with <code>--beta</code>. The <a href="guide.html#gpui">guide</a> has the steps.
install-jayjay-appimage-from-aur-for = 為 x86_64 或 aarch64 安裝 <a href="https://aur.archlinux.org/packages/jayjay-appimage">AUR 中的 <code>jayjay-appimage</code></a>，例如 <code>yay -S jayjay-appimage</code>。自訂 pacman 儲存庫已停用；透過 AUR 升級前，請從 <code>/etc/pacman.conf</code> 中刪除整個 <code>[jayjay]</code> 區段。若要試用 AppImage 測試版，請先移除已安裝的套件，再以 <code>--beta</code> 執行 Linux 安裝指令碼。<a href="guide.html#gpui">指南</a>（英文）中有詳細步驟。

# Does JayJay work on Windows or Linux?
does-jayjay-work-on-windows-or = JayJay 能在 Windows 或 Linux 上執行嗎？

# Linux and Windows use the GPUI shell and share the Rust core with macOS. Linux ships as an AppImage, Debian/Ubuntu package, and AUR package for x86_64 and aarch64; see the <a href="guide.html#gpui">guide</a>. Windows support is in beta. Install Windows x64 from the <a href="https://apps.microsoft.com/detail/9pjrq1hg25vb">Microsoft Store</a>, or use the portable ZIP from <a href="https://github.com/hewigovens/jayjay/releases">GitHub Releases</a> for beta builds. Windows requires Windows 10 version 1903 or later, or Windows 11, with <code>jj</code> installed separately. The Store manages its updates; the portable ZIP has no automatic updater.
linux-and-windows-use-the-gpui = Linux 和 Windows 使用 GPUI 介面，並與 macOS 共用 Rust 核心。Linux 版以 AppImage、Debian/Ubuntu 套件和 AUR 套件提供，支援 x86_64 和 aarch64；詳見<a href="guide.html#gpui">指南</a>（英文）。Windows 支援處於測試階段。可從 <a href="https://apps.microsoft.com/detail/9pjrq1hg25vb">Microsoft Store</a> 安裝 Windows x64 版，或使用 <a href="https://github.com/hewigovens/jayjay/releases">GitHub Releases</a> 上的可攜式 ZIP 取得測試版組建。Windows 需要 Windows 10 版本 1903 或以上，或 Windows 11，並需另行安裝 <code>jj</code>。Store 版由 Store 管理更新；可攜式 ZIP 沒有自動更新功能。

